Z: 1-8   1C and 2C dance 4H round and back
Z: 9-16  1C and 2C dance 4H across and back
Z: 17-24 1C lead down with RH, cross over between 2C, cast up round 2C on opposite sides, cross over giving LH and cast off one place on own sides.  2C move up on bars 23-24
Z: 25-28 2C and 1C turn by RH once round
Z: 29-32 2C and 1C turn by LH once round
Z: repeat having passed a couple
